{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>USSR, 1986.</strong> When Ira Grachevskaya goes missing in the closed city of Vorkuta-5, not a soul seems to be concerned \u2013 except for the quiet outcast Asya Shubina, that is. Uncover the mystery behind Ira\u2019s disappearance, transmit your radio signal to the universe and learn why a bird flies past the window.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHARACTERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet the cast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4122860/extras/25bd34448379482dd0abd2bfaf7b5444.avif?t=1761346239\" width=1200 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A problem child and a truant, Ira doesn't have the best reputation. Her standoffish demeanor makes her difficult to talk to, especially for someone as meek as you. There is a rumour she's been meeting with an older man.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4122860/extras/d1b16c71f3c94d51701b893ef4b30156.avif?t=1761346239\" width=1200 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Marina's carefree personality makes her quite popular among her classmates. Adults don't seem to like her very much, probably due to poor grades. Despite the girl's outgoing nature, her worldview is rather cynical.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4122860/extras/d6e4e98679a18534bb746b90da1fd463.avif?t=1761346239\" width=1200 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A boy with an unpleasant sense of humour. Likes picking on people weaker than him, namely you. His family has been a little out of it the past few weeks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4122860/extras/71ee44b92da459b967e876f0e13c55d5.avif?t=1761346239\" width=1200 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You.</strong> Not worth writing about.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME INFO</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Z.A.T.O. is a linear visual novel with roughly 7-8 hours of playtime. There are no choices. The ending is predetermined. Sit back and enjoy your time in a town that doesn't exist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DISCLAIMER:</strong> <strong>the game contains strong language, loud noises and flickering images.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4122860?t=1761346239","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4122860/6be18404335f3c943401dd9e0d06e805e4b4f4f2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761346239","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4122860/c88030f4113af2ea12d714084d16115689c9a361/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761346239","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4122860/c88030f4113af2ea12d714084d16115689c9a361/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761346239","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>USSR, 1986.</strong> When Ira Grachevskaya goes missing in the closed city of Vorkuta-5, not a soul seems to be concerned \u2013 except for the quiet outcast Asya Shubina, that is. Uncover the mystery behind Ira\u2019s disappearance, transmit your radio signal to the universe and learn why a bird flies past the window.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHARACTERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet the cast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4122860/extras/25bd34448379482dd0abd2bfaf7b5444.avif?t=1761346239\" width=1200 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A problem child and a truant, Ira doesn't have the best reputation. Her standoffish demeanor makes her difficult to talk to, especially for someone as meek as you. There is a rumour she's been meeting with an older man.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4122860/extras/d1b16c71f3c94d51701b893ef4b30156.avif?t=1761346239\" width=1200 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Marina's carefree personality makes her quite popular among her classmates. Adults don't seem to like her very much, probably due to poor grades. Despite the girl's outgoing nature, her worldview is rather cynical.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4122860/extras/d6e4e98679a18534bb746b90da1fd463.avif?t=1761346239\" width=1200 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A boy with an unpleasant sense of humour. Likes picking on people weaker than him, namely you. His family has been a little out of it the past few weeks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4122860/extras/71ee44b92da459b967e876f0e13c55d5.avif?t=1761346239\" width=1200 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You.</strong> Not worth writing about.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME INFO</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Z.A.T.O. is a linear visual novel with roughly 7-8 hours of playtime. There are no choices. The ending is predetermined. Sit back and enjoy your time in a town that doesn't exist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DISCLAIMER:</strong> <strong>the game contains strong language, loud noises and flickering images.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Ferry // Nopanamaman"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4122860/793d96b99e4c7b841720fdbf7b87ddbf7c85fb56/header.jpg?t=1761346239","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 18.04 LTS or equivalent distro<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual-core CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 2.0 compatible GPU<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 400 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.13 High Sierra or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel or Apple Silicon (Rosetta 2 supported)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 2.0 compatible<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 400 MB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4122860/746485968/2d20ae14043d8defa07653af00c2dff2dcd925b6/1761069943/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761343582","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4122860/746485968/2d20ae14043d8defa07653af00c2dff2dcd925b6/1761069943/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761343582","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4122860/746485968/2d20ae14043d8defa07653af00c2dff2dcd925b6/1761069943/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761343582","id":257219910,"mp4":{"480"